<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>PayloadType</key>
	<string>Configuration</string>
	<key>PayloadVersion</key>
	<integer>1</integer>
	<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
	<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS</string>
	<key>PayloadUUID</key>
	<string>791251C0-B644-5229-B28A-F1690A7D7C2C</string>
	<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
	<string>howToSafeDNS · CleanBrowsing · DoH</string>
	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>This file contains a single DNS configuration only. It does not include a root certificate, VPN, device management enrollment or app installation. You can inspect the XML source on GitHub.

The profile is unsigned. “Unsigned” means it has no distributor signature; this is separate from the DNS connection's TLS encryption. Check the name and DNS addresses on the installation screen before deciding to install.

The free Security filter blocks phishing, spam and malicious domains. It is not an adult-content filter, and legitimate sites may also be blocked incorrectly.

CleanBrowsing states that its free DNS does not record or store identifying information, such as IP addresses, that could link queries to a person. It processes anonymous aggregate DNS data to operate the service.

Privacy policy: https://cleanbrowsing.org/privacy</string>
	<key>PayloadScope</key>
	<string>System</string>
	<key>PayloadContent</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>PayloadType</key>
			<string>com.apple.dnsSettings.managed</string>
			<key>PayloadVersion</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
			<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS.dns</string>
			<key>PayloadUUID</key>
			<string>465F01A2-A7C6-5F47-B92A-F95AF850D3BA</string>
			<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
			<string>howToSafeDNS · CleanBrowsing · DoH</string>
			<key>DNSSettings</key>
			<dict>
				<key>DNSProtocol</key>
				<string>HTTPS</string>
				<key>ServerAddresses</key>
				<array>
					<string>185.228.168.9</string>
					<string>185.228.169.9</string>
					<string>2a0d:2a00:1::2</string>
					<string>2a0d:2a00:2::2</string>
				</array>
				<key>ServerURL</key>
				<string>https://doh.cleanbrowsing.org/doh/security-filter/</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
